      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "The biggest status symbol for Gen Z is something you can't buy."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:02.50",
      "end_time": "00:04.20",
      "start_ms": 2500,
      "end_ms": 4200,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Taste. Think about it."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:04.20",
      "end_time": "00:06.00",
      "start_ms": 4200,
      "end_ms": 6000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Everyone has started doing the same things."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:06.00",
      "end_time": "00:10.00",
      "start_ms": 6000,
      "end_ms": 10000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "The books you are reading, the logos you are wearing, things you are talking about,"
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:10.00",
      "end_time": "00:13.00",
      "start_ms": 10000,
      "end_ms": 13000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "and even how you style yourself."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:13.00",
      "end_time": "00:15.50",
      "start_ms": 13000,
      "end_ms": 15500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "But rich are doing it very differently."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:15.50",
      "end_time": "00:20.10",
      "start_ms": 15500,
      "end_ms": 20100,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Their interest lies in architecture, culture, arts, books, vintage items."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:20.10",
      "end_time": "00:22.70",
      "start_ms": 20100,
      "end_ms": 22700,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "And Gen Z is also going in the same direction."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:22.70",
      "end_time": "00:27.50",
      "start_ms": 22700,
      "end_ms": 27500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Because when everyone starts looking expensive, expensive stops feeling special."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:27.50",
      "end_time": "00:31.90",
      "start_ms": 27500,
      "end_ms": 31900,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "So the new flex is knowing something, and being a part of the tribe not everyone else can reach to."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:31.90",
      "end_time": "00:36.50",
      "start_ms": 31900,
      "end_ms": 36500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Basically something that shows that you've got taste, because your personality and thinking is a reflection of that."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:36.50",
      "end_time": "00:39.00",
      "start_ms": 36500,
      "end_ms": 39000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "And that is the new status symbol."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:39.00",
      "end_time": "00:42.50",
      "start_ms": 39000,
      "end_ms": 42500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "So if you are building a brand, build a world that people want to be a part of."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:42.50",
      "end_time": "00:47.00",
      "start_ms": 42500,
      "end_ms": 47000,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Build something people with taste would like to carry it and show it off."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:47.00",
      "end_time": "00:50.50",
      "start_ms": 47000,
      "end_ms": 50500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "Because money can buy you expensive logos, but taste differentiates on another level."
    },
    {
      "start_time": "00:50.50",
      "end_time": "00:51.50",
      "start_ms": 50500,
      "end_ms": 51500,
      "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
      "speaker_name": "Host",
      "is_on_screen": true,
      "edit_type": "synced",
      "text": "That's it."
    }
  ],
